        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 13:6",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Then David sent home to Tamar, saying, Go now to thy brother Amnon’s house, and dress him meat.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 13:7",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "So Tamar went to her brother Amnon’s house; and he was laid down. And she took flour, and kneaded it, and made cakes in his sight, and did bake the cakes.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 98,
