        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And she took a pan, and poured them out before him; but he refused to eat. And Amnon said, Have out all men from me. And they went out every man from him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
